00:08:05.130 --> 00:08:07.080
like this guy, like a dear friend of ours.

00:08:07.080 --> 00:08:08.209
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:08:08.209 --> 00:08:09.510
- Then I got with the
director, we were adding that

00:08:09.510 --> 00:08:10.980
and he kept on going, a little bit higher,

00:08:10.980 --> 00:08:12.660
and I was like how how
how bout how bout here.

00:08:12.660 --> 00:08:15.030
Maybe higher. Okay maybe,
maybe like here, like in here.

00:08:15.030 --> 00:08:15.990
How bout a little bit higher.

00:08:15.990 --> 00:08:17.400
Okay a little bit higher than there.

00:08:17.400 --> 00:08:19.140
He goes, can you go a
little bit higher Keegan?

00:08:19.140 --> 00:08:20.848
I can try. And and.

00:08:20.848 --> 00:08:22.050
(laughter)

00:08:22.050 --> 00:08:23.400
And then eventually I got to a place

00:08:23.400 --> 00:08:25.140
where I literally thought to myself

00:08:25.140 --> 00:08:29.072
can I just act like, as an
actor, just act like I'm going

00:08:29.072 --> 00:08:30.090
(air sucking in)

00:08:30.090 --> 00:08:31.080
on a helium balloon.

00:08:31.080 --> 00:08:32.106
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:08:32.106 --> 00:08:33.713
- And then starting the session
(in high pitched voice).

00:08:33.713 --> 00:08:34.577
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:08:34.577 --> 00:08:35.669
- And then starting the
session and doing the voice.

00:08:35.669 --> 00:08:36.511
(cheers and applause)

00:08:36.511 --> 00:08:37.544
- It just takes,

00:08:37.544 --> 00:08:40.020
it takes a very bold
person to just walk in.

00:08:40.020 --> 00:08:40.890
I remember the first time I ever did it,

00:08:40.890 --> 00:08:42.960
I was like you want me
to what? And I was like.

00:08:42.960 --> 00:08:44.280
And I just got nervous about it

00:08:44.280 --> 00:08:46.170
'cause it's like there's so many people

00:08:46.170 --> 00:08:47.550
in the studio watching you.

00:08:47.550 --> 00:08:48.566
- And you're going for it.

00:08:48.566 --> 00:08:49.399
- Look like a tool.

00:08:49.399 --> 00:08:52.372
- Yeah, you're like you're
going for it, by yourself.

00:08:52.372 --> 00:08:53.205
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:08:53.205 --> 00:08:55.814
- [Keegan] It's so rare
to be able to do it

00:08:55.814 --> 00:08:56.647
- [Kelly] On an island.

00:08:56.647 --> 00:08:57.480
- With other people you know.

00:08:57.480 --> 00:08:58.770
- [Kelly] Anyway, you all do a killer job,

00:08:58.770 --> 00:09:00.063
I'm so excited about it.

